  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to International Conference on Population and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of a High-Level Panel on ICPD is to ensure implementation by UN member states of women and girls&#x2019; fundamental right to decide over their own body. The Panel will contribute to this by ensuring follow-up and follow-through on the commitments made at the Nairobi Summit on the implementation of the ICPD PoA before the 2030-deadline. Full implementation of the ICPD PoA will contribute significantly to lifting especially women and girls out of poverty in LDCs.</narrative>
  </description>
